title: "sovereign-stack"
abstract: >-
  A three-part gateway for public-sector IT: bounded queries answered with
  commitments and range proofs, compliance assessment in strong Kleene logic
  against the NIST SP 800-53 rev5 baselines, and offline-first replication that
  converges without losing an operation.
